WASHINGTON — The U.S. Department of Homeland Security (DHS) highlights more heinous criminal illegal aliens arrested across the country yesterday, including those convicted of lewd or lascivious acts with a child, third-degree sex offense, and voluntary manslaughter.

> Sanctuary city policies prevent information sharing and prevent our law enforcement from being notified of a criminal illegal alien's release from jail. These are just a few of the criminals our ICE law enforcement risked their lives to arrest yesterday: pedophiles, sex offenders, and murderers,

said Assistant Secretary Tricia McLaughlin.

> Nothing will stop ICE law enforcement from removing criminals from American communities. When you see an ICE law enforcement officer, thank them for risking their lives to make your neighborhoods safer.

